{
  "session_id": "d22-d22-t4",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《Building a Massive Corpus for Named Entity Recognition Using Free Open Data Sources》，Is the dataset completely automatically generated?",
      "turn_id": "a694eb11ecc64ae5a5ac727e78614fad"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "method_automatic_generation",
            "text": "论文提出一种方法，可从公共数据源自动生成用于 NER 的标注数据集，该方法利用 DBpedia 与 Wikipedia 的链接和结构化数据进行生成。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "no_human_supervision",
            "text": "作者指出，其方法无需人工监督即可构建 NER 标注数据集，数据源为按语义网原则组织的 DBpedia 与 Wikipedia。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "silver_standard",
            "text": "该工作被描述为构建一个大规模弱监督数据集（即银标准语料库），并以这种方式生成葡萄牙语 NER 数据集 SESAME。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "automated_methodology_section",
            "text": "论文说明，自动生成该数据集的方法在方法章节中给出。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "auxiliary_predictor",
            "text": "与 BIBREF2 相比，该方法使用一个辅助 NER 预测器来捕捉缺失的实体，从而获得更密集的标注。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "human_built_source_structure",
            "text": "Wikipedia 的内部链接与信息框被视为关键，因为它们捕捉了人类构建的、关于文本与命名实体关系的知识。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1908.05758",
                "chunk_id": "c-4e8edb01587cf58272827de0"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "turn_id": "a694eb11ecc64ae5a5ac727e78614fad"
    },
